[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i25"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……今天依然炎热。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但一想到这是暑假，这份炎热就不可思议地不令人讨厌了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"假的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还是热。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11300"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“喂――！羽依里～”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……嗯？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11336"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“呀嚯～”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哦，鸥啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你怎么在这？前面只有灯塔哦？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11245"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“那就对了。我就是想去灯塔呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真稀奇。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11288"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“嘿嘿，我给紬紬带了份伴手礼。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“伴手礼？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只见她的行李箱外绑着吕客罐。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i129"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14619"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14131"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“姆啾！羽依里先生和鸥。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14063"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“今天怎么了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“一大早就是奇装异服啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11321"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“猫，牛……”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11364"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“我，鸥。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯？是啊，怎么了……？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14588"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14080"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11257"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“猫！牛！海鸥！”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11243"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“桃太郎似的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你们家的桃太郎故事都咋讲的啊？”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11261"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“这组合好像很强啊。是吧，桃太郎。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还把我当成桃太郎了吗……"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14566"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11307"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“啊，不说这个了。我带来了这个。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14672"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“哦！是吕客！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14692"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“而且还有这么多……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14690"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“都绑在外面了，那莫非里面也……？”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11336"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“里面没有哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那这行李箱的意义是什么……”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11240"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“因为我有去各种地方找东西，所以发现了很多。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11261"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“然后想起了紬紬正需要这个，于是就收集起来了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14605"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“谢谢！”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"clear","layer":1539},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14698"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“话说回来，你找到了你在找的东西吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11240"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“还没呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11307"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“紬紬找到了想做的事情和自己吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14665"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“还没有。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11370"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“嗯……看来我们都还得继续努力啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14731"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“那个……从灯塔上望，说不定就能找到你在找的东西。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14690"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“要上去吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11295"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“可以吗!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14659"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“当然了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14628"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“这边请。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11326"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“好～”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"怎么回事。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看到紬和我们小圈子外的人关系好，虽然很开心……但又有点嫉妒。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14121"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看来我们的心胸都不怎么宽广啊。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"clear","layer":1539},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11335"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“谢谢你啦！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"鸥拿着一只海鸥布偶挥着手。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看来是紬送她的。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14692"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“下次再见！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真不错，收到了这么多吕客罐。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14602"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“嗯。所以我也把我的朋友送给了她作为谢礼。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“今天要怎么找你想做的事情？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14690"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“关于这个，其实我和静久已经商量好了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14659"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“你猜猜我们要干什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我想想……嗯～”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14642"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“抢答。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“还有这种规则啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"按照平时来考虑的话。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“在灯塔……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14137"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“错啦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我还没说完呢。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14729"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“正确答案是……去恋人家。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"公布正确答案也太快了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉？你们要来我家？早说嘛，我还得收拾收拾房间。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14622"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“姆喵……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14083"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“哞～♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……该不会是想蒙混过关？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我该怎么理解这两声叫声？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14574"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“……对不起。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14590"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“我想去羽依里先生的房间，不会给你添麻烦的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14627"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“是这个意思。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那声短短的“姆喵～”竟然还有这么丰富的含义。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14084"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“哞～♪”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14115"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“就是这个意思。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这位倒是字面意思。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉算了。反正我房间也没那么乱，走吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14692"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“哦～我好开心。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14118"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“谢谢你，乳依里♪”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14729"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“我们走吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14066"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嗯♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……唉？别穿着这身啊。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i25"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14507"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“快走吧～”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“路很颠簸，跑步很危险的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13820"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“哈哈♪她真的很期待啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你不跑吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13840"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“唉？我……跑？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我还以为你要跟着紬一起跑起来呢……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13804"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“乳依里呀……你觉得我胸前有什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呃……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"面对着女孩子，我怎么可能把“奶子”二字说出口。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13791"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“没错，就是你知道的库柏韧带！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13820"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“都说到这份上了，你肯定也知道我想说什么了吧♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……不知道。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这个词可能还是我第一次听到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“抱歉，静久。……库柏韧带是啥？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13800"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……唉？乳依里……你认真的？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13804"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“就是库柏韧带哦，库柏韧带。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“抱歉。我第一次听到。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13788"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……这样。……是这样啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她看上去非常伤心。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13755"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“没什么，羽依里。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……而且对我的称呼也从乳依里变成了羽依里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也许我让静久很失望。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i58"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“就是这里了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14461"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“哦～……真气派。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“和灯塔还是没法比的啦。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我回来了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11580"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“欢迎回来。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14420"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i13743"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11548"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬·静久","text":"“打扰了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11583"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“你们好。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这位是镜子阿姨。是照顾我的亲戚。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i13737"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我前不久打过一次招呼啦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11580"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“两位请多指教啦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14396"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊……对了，镜子阿姨。你知道这支曲子吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11577"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“唉？曲子？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14423"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“～～～♪”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11610"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11613"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“对不起，我好像不知道。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14388"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“这样啊……好可惜。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11621"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“对不起哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我去拿点喝的，你们先进那边的房间吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14384"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i13740"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“好的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11549"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“啊……羽依里。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“在。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11581"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“和你交往的是今天第一次来的那个吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是、是的……是这样没错。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11595"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“这种时候我该怎么表现呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……呃。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11608"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“我作为你在这座岛上的监护人，是不是该和她打个招呼？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那什么，其实不用。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11617"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“是吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11614"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“不过……我也很少在岛上看到过那个女孩，她很难得一见啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好像是这样的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11599"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“想和她稍微聊聊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……确实，毕竟她总是待在没人来的灯塔。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"很少见到她和岛上的居民说话。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而且欢迎会上，她也没有来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就连镜子阿姨，也把她当成了珍稀物种。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i68"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14497"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“这，这里就是羽依里先生的房间啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，别客气。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14404"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“……姆叽～”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你怎么了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14410"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“我，我现在很紧张。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14414"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“因为我从没有进过男人的房间。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13764"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“这里都没什么大包小包的啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“因为计划暑假结束就回去，所以就带了点换洗衣物。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14492"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“是这样啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14386"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“夏天结束后，羽依里先生和我都要回去了呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13807"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我也是。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14388"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“……大家都要从岛上消失了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……是啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这个夏天结束后。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也许今后再也没有机会能见到她们俩了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"特别是三人一起……就更难了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"要是再加上在灯塔前……就更是天方夜谭了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我思考了一番夏天结束后的情景。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13846"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我们去找找想做的事吧♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，说得对。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14381"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“好。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"clear","layer":1539},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13737"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我想了很多紬可能会想做的事情。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14529"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“哦～……有没有什么好主意呀？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13770"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我可以说些奶子的话题吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你平时不就在说吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14522"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“平时就在说了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13775"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我有个建议，要不要试试让紬的奶子大起来？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“可是她做的丰胸体操，甚至没能让她的胸围增加0.1厘米。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14477"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“是啊。我肯定没有奶子的才能。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13820"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“没事。就算没有奶子的才能，努努力也是有希望的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14497"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“可是……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13834"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“你不相信我对奶子的见解吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14404"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“姆啾～……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14401"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“羽依里先生喜欢大奶子吗？”"},{"op":"choice","variable":6001,"items":[{"text":"喜欢","value":0,"condition":1},{"text":"接受不了","value":1,"condition":1},{"text":"我喜欢你的","value":2,"condition":1}]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“姆叽哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14396"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13843"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“你说什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“抱歉。脑子里想得有点多。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14506"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“不过，既然静久这么说……那可以试试。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13740"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“那就这么定了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13743"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“羽依里能出去一下吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唔，嗯。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"隐约能听到她们在说着什么。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"偷听可不好。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过就算不听，声音也会传到我的耳朵里，没办法。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13769"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“好了，可以进来啦～”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那我进来了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i68"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“紬变成巨乳了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13804"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嗯～……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14454"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“姆啾～……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啊……"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14388"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“感觉硌得慌。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“怎么感觉你这巨乳还有沙沙声？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13767"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我塞了点东西进去。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13764"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“但因为紬的衣服尺寸等原因，不是很顺利。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13843"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“紬果然没有奶子的才能。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“放弃得有够干脆。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14497"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“姆啾～……好难受。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“歪了哦？”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i256"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14498"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我把手托上了沙沙响的胸。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14415"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“姆啾!؟奶，奶子被摸了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呃。我以为是填充物就没关系。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14502"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉……回头一想，我是做了不该做的事情。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对不起，紬！”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i68"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“……不，不用。没事的，请不要看我。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“我的脸现在有点奇怪。可能非常夸张。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呃，好……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"奇怪到底是怎么样一副表情啊……"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13823"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“乳依里呀♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……叫法回来了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13846"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“就是这个！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哪个？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13816"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“自然而然地把要歪了的奶子挪正！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13813"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“这绅士的举止让我好心动♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这都能心动啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我自然的性骚扰被她表扬了。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":2},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i60"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14381"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“那么，明天见。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，再见。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13834"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“对了，乳依里。要是枕头睡起来不舒服的话，我先道个歉。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“枕头？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14410"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“刚才做巨乳的时候用到了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯嗯？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13820"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“为了让紬穿上我的内衣，我塞了枕头的棉花进去。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13816"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“当然后来塞回去了，不过可能不太均匀，睡起来不舒服。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"慢着……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……棉花。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"夹在紬的胸部和静久的胸罩之间的……棉花。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这棉花塞回了枕头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后今晚……我要枕在这上面？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"话说，既然静久的胸罩是紬穿着，"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那刚才静久一直都是……没穿胸――"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14396"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13837"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":" “――鹰原羽依里！” "},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"静久是为了寻找紬想做的事情而努力！"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14494"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13737"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"别想乱七八糟的！"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14526"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“嘶――……”"},{"op":"image","layer":515,"image":"i18121"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i248"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14495"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":" “"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"紬！文德斯！” "},{"op":"clear","layer":515},{"op":"clear","layer":768},{"op":"clear","layer":1024},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“――!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i60"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13755"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嘶――……”"},{"op":"image","layer":515,"image":"i18121"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i248"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13753"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":" “"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"水织――！静久――！” "},{"op":"clear","layer":515},{"op":"clear","layer":768},{"op":"clear","layer":1024},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":515,"image":"i18121"},{"op":"clear","layer":0},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i248"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14559"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":" 